<section class="ds-section" id="nooraya">
  <div class="ds-wrap">
    <div class="ds-split">
      <div class="ds-split-media">
        <img src="/imagery/dolphin-and-sound/nooraya-aerial.jpg" alt="The Nooraya anchored among the corals of Sataya Reef, from above" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="ds-split-copy">
        <span class="ds-eyebrow">Marvelling in the Sataya Reef</span>
        <h2 class="ds-h2">Six days in <em>Dolphin Bay</em></h2>
        <div class="ds-prose">
          <p>
            Experience the enchanting beauty of Sataya’s “Dolphin Bay,” one of the Red Sea’s most
            stunning reefs. For six unforgettable days our boat anchors in this serene haven, where
            playful spinner dolphins visit daily, often inviting you into their world of joy and
            spontaneity.
          </p>
          <p>
            When the dolphins are away, immerse yourself in the reef’s vibrant underwater tapestry
            of corals and exotic marine life — a hidden world of wonder.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ds-split ds-split--reverse">
      <div class="ds-split-media">
        <img src="/imagery/dolphin-and-sound/nooraya-salon.jpg" alt="The warm wood-panelled salon of the Nooraya" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="ds-split-copy">
        <span class="ds-eyebrow">Aboard the Nooraya</span>
        <h2 class="ds-h2">A home on <em>the water</em></h2>
        <div class="ds-prose">
          <p>
            Your journey is made complete aboard the <em>Nooraya</em> — a 29-metre-long, 7-metre-wide
            boat designed for comfort and tranquillity. Fully refurbished, it offers shaded decks and
            sunlit spaces for relaxation, socialising, and soaking in the beauty of Sataya.
          </p>
          <p>
            Inside are cozy lounges, a traditional Egyptian salon with a bar and dining area, and
            eight cabins with private bathrooms. Meals are prepared by a chef who blends flavours
            from different cuisines throughout the week, and a dedicated crew of experienced guides
            ensures smooth sailing and unforgettable water experiences.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
